{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25466","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 芳荪 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 芳荪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客重兰荪，遗芳今未歇。\n叶抽清浅水，花照暄妍节。\n紫艳映渠鲜，轻香含露洁。\n离居若有赠，暂与幽人折。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}